{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/732483b75e27db42f170b3ca69e8d9e7.avif?t=1767114906\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.poster.avif?t=1767114906\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.webm?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.mp4?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your blind companion handles the battles, while you, small and agile, take charge of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes you must pull your ally away from danger to survive, and other times push them into the heart of enemies to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic positioning of allies and foes can also maximize your skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/93c77fbc6801555fb5a6433c16d599a5.avif?t=1767114906\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.poster.avif?t=1767114906\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.webm?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.mp4?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat monsters to earn loot and gold, then build your skill and loot decks to unleash powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade for essential items or recruit mighty allies through special events to strengthen your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine skills, loot, and companions to craft your own strategies and experience fresh battles each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With the perfect synergy, you might even crush bosses with overwhelming power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/4d9711f81b1daab7f1987622bd0cb796.avif?t=1767114906\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.poster.avif?t=1767114906\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.webm?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.mp4?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as unique characters such as a balanced samurai or a powerful but slow sorcerer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Different bosses and regions await, each demanding new tactics depending on their combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge new builds with every run and enjoy your own distinctive combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat the Goblin Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/67d8ee92ca72b94a7a9dfab007373c1c1174ce51.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Goblin Chieftain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/804276034169fe9c55dc0be892c3cafaef620ac6.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Enraged Goblin Chieftain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/b53973b2f2e0ff760caf57fe338e0e51d7e223d8.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Specter Deckhand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/6cbadda4e968ca8f52a7e41cf571d5118e371905.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Specter Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/5b57e98398ea90ffb1a5dc1eea4c4d49f557ba2c.jpg"},{"name":"Specter Admiral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/e2706eed09422066206a40bd2d93cab058f06cf6.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Blind Samurai","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/5b7764628d3143370e7441333cb0294b671caa4c.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of the Blind Samurai","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/27719cac3a45f5bf13dff2fbcdff7489a070a595.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Blind Mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/db53cb98782eb9eec49564efe2b15fafc1df7bc8.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of the Blind Mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3876950/7680590befa1f284db0cbe061c46362e5dbba5ef.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876950?t=1767114906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876950?t=1767114906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/3b72cb5453da7bd72dba96cfbc53d79ad4a017e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767114906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/3b72cb5453da7bd72dba96cfbc53d79ad4a017e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767114906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3917540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/732483b75e27db42f170b3ca69e8d9e7.avif?t=1767114906\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.poster.avif?t=1767114906\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.webm?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.mp4?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your blind companion handles the battles, while you, small and agile, take charge of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes you must pull your ally away from danger to survive, and other times push them into the heart of enemies to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic positioning of allies and foes can also maximize your skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/93c77fbc6801555fb5a6433c16d599a5.avif?t=1767114906\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.poster.avif?t=1767114906\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.webm?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.mp4?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat monsters to earn loot and gold, then build your skill and loot decks to unleash powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade for essential items or recruit mighty allies through special events to strengthen your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine skills, loot, and companions to craft your own strategies and experience fresh battles each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With the perfect synergy, you might even crush bosses with overwhelming power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/4d9711f81b1daab7f1987622bd0cb796.avif?t=1767114906\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.poster.avif?t=1767114906\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.webm?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.mp4?t=1767114906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as unique characters such as a balanced samurai or a powerful but slow sorcerer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Different bosses and regions await, each demanding new tactics depending on their combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge new builds with every run and enjoy your own distinctive combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ArmedPeseant"],"genres":[{"descript