1080.jpg?t=1767114906","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/5d9cdc3d7fff2e9a9e3df68179523611bf72ea39/ss_5d9cdc3d7fff2e9a9e3df68179523611bf72ea39.600x338.jpg?t=1767114906"}],"short_description":"SAMUKID is a unique strategic action roguelike deck-building game where combat and movement are separate roles. Build powerful synergies between dice-based battles and grid-based movement, and lead the blind samurai and his young companion on a legendary journey!","steam_appid":3876950,"support_info":{"email":"TTobing3@gmail.com","url":"https://x.com/ArmedPeseant"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}